<section class="admin-shell"><nav class="settings-nav" aria-label="Administration"><a href="/admin">Overview</a><a href="/admin/users">Users</a><a href="/admin/repositories">Repositories</a><a href="/admin/plugins">Plugins</a><a href="/admin/audit">Audit log</a><a aria-current="page" href="/admin/search">Search index</a></nav><div class="settings-content"><h1>Search index</h1><div class="stat-grid"><% Object.entries(it.status).forEach(function(pair) { %><article><strong><%= pair[1] %></strong><span><%= pair[0] %></span></article><% }) %></div><p>Rebuilds run asynchronously after pushes and web commits. Use <code>bareline search rebuild</code> for a full administrative rebuild.</p></div></section>
